<li><a href="../../firewall/tutorial-firewall-deploy-portal" data-linktype="relative-path">Deploy and configure Azure Firewall</a></li>
<li><a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/pricing/details/azure-firewall/" data-linktype="external">Azure Firewall pricing</a></li>
</ul>
